{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000332","bookName":"Sin ella, mi mundo no tiene sentido","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000000332/42000000332.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":2645522,"followCount":33098,"introduction":"Valeria, una huérfana que trabaja como guardaespaldas de Leandro, lo ayudó a levantarse desde la nada, pero nunca se sometió a él. Decidido a quebrarla, Leandro la manipuló usando el nombre de su amor ideal, Isabel, y la llenó de tormentos. Valeria fingió su muerte y huyó, pero él la halló y, desesperado, la hipnotizó para borrar sus recuerdos. Solo entonces entendió que sin ella, su mundo no tenía sentido.","chapterCount":77,"labels":["Love Triangle","All-Too-Late"],"tags":["Love Triangle","All-Too-Late"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Sin-ella-mi-mundo-no-tiene-sentido","bookNameLower":"sin-ella-mi-mundo-no-tiene-sentido","shelfTime":"2025-11-12 18:41:38","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-12 18:41:38","performerList":[{"performerId":"28908","performerName":"Weiyang Wang","performerFormatName":"Weiyang-Wang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x0/28908/28908.jpg?time=1783073880474","videoCount":4},{"performerId":"28201","performerName":"Yuyang Jin","performerFormatName":"Yuyang-Jin","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x0/28201/28201.jpg?time=1783073881465","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[28201,28908]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700021062","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/26/2x3/23x3/233x0/23300000024/700021062_1/700021062.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=DTGs1WAbjcpAY-ARCpcdUBK~dy7LUBbqG5Xw~7XS5Y3G8UfMnv36rRO6GBDHYXuGp8lYL2Auac1417dAMC6uK6GV~m~cTPWEL-bCWCEXoRm93btzismSBHunMTe6~tig0d4C~sRyUm0gIZVA2fVx4l84kk9pzAt1uhZeaHPnI4AAYgt1KT5eacEfcfQPYM